# Royal Treatment on Ornithopter: the creature gains hexproof until end of turn and a Royal Role token is created attached
# to it (CR 111.10m, 303.4): +1/+1, so a 1/3, and ward {1}. The hexproof the spell gives first does not stop the Role,
# which the effect attaches without targeting (the Role rulings). On Bot2's turn the hexproof is gone (CR 514.2), and
# Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at the Ornithopter with its only mana, so it cannot pay ward's {1} and the Bolt is countered
# (CR 702.21a). The next scenario is the control, in which Bot2 pays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Ornithopter
Royal Treatment
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

